# Beastmaster's native cue check, updated for the accepted #215 pack kit.
# Design 8423ac38, kit fa500819, damage a7fdfa77; full pack forms: 215/pack.pad.
# Beastmaster a against Beastmaster b; syntax and checks: smashcraft:docs/native-bot-session.md.
# A side special from standing starts a dash too, so each one slides its caster about 120.
#! chat -dev quick hero beastmaster
# b dashes right and summons its bear, then commands it right and left.
40 b stick 1 0
42 b stick 0 0
# a summons Quilbeast, then commands its volley from the air.
50 a stick 0 -1
50 a tap X 2
51 a stick 0 0
52 a capture
60 b stick 1 0
60 b tap X 2
61 b stick 0 0
68 a capture
100 a tap B 8
106 a stick 0 -1
106 a tap X 2
107 a stick 0 0
108 a capture
124 a capture
130 b stick 1 0
130 b tap X 2
131 b stick 0 0
# a summons its bear, then runs up to b with the bear following.
165 a stick 1 0
165 a tap X 2
166 a stick 0 0
167 a capture
185 b stick -1 0
185 b tap X 2
186 b stick 0 0
195 a capture
225 a stick 1 0
250 a stick 0 0
# a jabs, then commands Stampede: the two lizards spawn on command frames 12 and 20.
310 a tap A 2
314 a capture
315 a stick 1 0
330 a tap X 2
334 a tap X 2
336 a stick 0 0
336 a capture
338 a capture
349 a capture
# This volley press is early: Stampede still runs through frame 361.
360 a stick 0 -1
360 a tap X 2
361 a stick 0 0
362 a capture
364 a capture
# a runs left and throws Wild Axes; the second press cannot replace live axes.
390 a stick -1 0
# b climbs back from the ledge, summons Hawk, then commands its grounded dives.
400 b stick 0 1
402 b stick 0 0
415 a stick 0 0
430 a tap X 2
432 a capture
440 b stick -0.4 1
440 b tap X 2
441 b stick 0 0
450 a capture
480 a tap B 8
486 a tap X 2
488 a capture
# View held a second: the first of two moments the parity check replays.
500 a press VIEW
506 a capture
530 b stick -0.4 1
530 b tap X 2
531 b stick 0 0
# a: Summon Hawk on the ground; the airborne lift is covered by 215/pack.pad.
550 a stick 0 1
550 a tap X 2
551 a stick 0 0
552 a capture
560 a capture
570 a release VIEW
620 b stick -0.4 1
620 b tap X 2
621 b stick 0 0
710 b stick -0.4 1
710 b tap X 2
711 b stick 0 0
800 b stick -0.4 1
800 b tap X 2
801 b stick 0 0
890 b stick -0.4 1
890 b tap X 2
891 b stick 0 0
980 b stick -0.4 1
980 b tap X 2
981 b stick 0 0
982 b capture
990 b capture
1000 a press VIEW
1070 a release VIEW
1070 b stick -0.4 1
1070 b tap X 2
1071 b stick 0 0
# Authored expectations: recall form 3 commands a living animal; Hawk requires ground.
# Stampede starts on 330, so its frame-12/20 lizards contact on 341/349.
# Each deals f32(4 * 0.9): 3.600, then 7.200 total, with hitlag 4 and hitstun 13.
# Stampede ends on 330+32-1=361; Wild Axes ends on 430+35-1=464.
#! expect a 50 special 16 form 0
#! expect b 60 special 14 form 0
#! expect a 106 special 16 form 3
#! expect b 130 special 14 form 3
#! expect a 165 special 14 form 0
#! expect b 185 special 14 form 3
#! expect a 330 special 14 form 3
#! expect b 341 damage 3.600 hitlag 4 hitstun 13
#! expect b 349 damage 7.200 hitlag 4 hitstun 13
#! absent a 360-361 special 16
#! expect a 361 special 0 form 3
#! expect a 430 special 13 form 0
#! expect a 464 special 0 form 0
#! absent a 486-487 special 13
#! expect a 550 special 15 form 0
#! expect b 440 special 15 form 0
#! expect b 530 special 15 form 3
#! expect b 620 special 15 form 3
#! expect b 710 special 15 form 3
#! expect b 800 special 15 form 3
#! expect b 890 special 15 form 3
#! expect b 980 special 15 form 3
